(1. OPERATING PRINCIPLES) Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(This internal SOP converts policy evidence into controlled decisions.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SOP-1.1  Evidence hierarchy) Tj
T*
(   Use source documents and structured policy clauses. Model-generated summaries are aids) Tj
T*
(   and never controlling evidence.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SOP-1.2  Four-eyes control) Tj
T*
(   Final rejection, fraud action, high-value exception and policy-conflict decision require) Tj
T*
(   an authorized second reviewer.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SOP-1.3  Traceability) Tj
T*
(   Store input documents, extraction version, retrieved clauses, scores, reviewer edits,) Tj
T*
(   calculations, timestamps and final communication.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SOP-1.4  Least harmful uncertainty) Tj
T*
(   Unresolved uncertainty becomes a query or manual review, not an unsupported approval or) Tj
T*
(   rejection.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
