(2. END-TO-END WORKFLOW) Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(Steps may run concurrently only when dependencies remain controlled.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SOP-2.1  Register) Tj
T*
(   Assign claim ID, receipt time, channel, member ID and document inventory.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SOP-2.2  Secure and classify) Tj
T*
(   Malware-scan files, identify type and split compound uploads without altering originals.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SOP-2.3  Extract) Tj
T*
(   Run text and field extraction. Preserve source coordinates and confidence for names,) Tj
T*
(   dates, diagnosis, procedure and amounts.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SOP-2.4  Validate identity) Tj
T*
(   Match member and patient using normalized fields and authorized master data.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SOP-2.5  Establish policy scope) Tj
T*
(   Select policy, plan, member category, effective version, geography and endorsements) Tj
T*
(   before clause retrieval.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SOP-2.6  Check completeness) Tj
T*
(   Use AIEHBP-CLM-003 and issue a specific deficiency request where necessary.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SOP-2.7  Retrieve evidence) Tj
T*
(   Run separate queries for benefit, exclusion, waiting period, required evidence, limit and) Tj
T*
(   exception. Apply metadata filters.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SOP-2.8  Medical review) Tj
T*
(   Assess necessity, diagnosis status, causation, coding, stay and experimental status where) Tj
T*
(   rules require.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SOP-2.9  Calculate) Tj
T*
(   Reconcile bills and apply non-payables, package rates, sublimits, room rules, deductible,) Tj
T*
(   co-pay, balance and restoration in order.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SOP-2.10  Decide) Tj
T*
(   Select approved, partially approved, rejected, pending information or manual review with) Tj
T*
(   reason codes.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SOP-2.11  Quality control) Tj
T*
(   Perform mandatory or sampled second review based on risk tier.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SOP-2.12  Communicate and pay) Tj
T*
(   Issue cited explanation, payment statement and grievance information; reconcile payment) Tj
T*
(   status.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
endstream
