(4. DECISION MATRIX) Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(Every final decision must satisfy the relevant branch.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SOP-4.1  Approve) Tj
T*
(   Eligibility active, benefit applies, evidence sufficient, no controlling exclusion,) Tj
T*
(   necessity established and payable amount greater than zero.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SOP-4.2  Partially approve) Tj
T*
(   Some claimed items are covered and others are limited or excluded; provide line-item) Tj
T*
(   calculation and clauses.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SOP-4.3  Reject) Tj
T*
(   No payable benefit remains because a clearly applicable exclusion, non-eligibility,) Tj
T*
(   exhausted benefit or unsupported insured event controls after review.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SOP-4.4  Pending information) Tj
T*
(   Material evidence is missing or unclear and can reasonably be supplied.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SOP-4.5  Manual review) Tj
T*
(   Policy conflict, low extraction confidence, complex clinical issue, fraud concern, high) Tj
T*
(   financial impact or system anomaly exists.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
endstream
