(5. PAYABLE AMOUNT SEQUENCE) Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(Use decimal currency and retain every intermediate value.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SOP-5.1  Step A claimed amount) Tj
T*
(   Start with reconciled final billed amount, not the member-entered number alone.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SOP-5.2  Step B discounts and duplicates) Tj
T*
(   Subtract discounts, refunds, duplicated package items and arithmetic errors.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SOP-5.3  Step C non-payable items) Tj
T*
(   Apply clause-supported non-payables at line-item level.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SOP-5.4  Step D tariff and reasonable charge) Tj
T*
(   Apply contracted package or documented reasonable and customary limit.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SOP-5.5  Step E benefit sublimits) Tj
T*
(   Apply maternity, cataract, AYUSH, ambulance and other benefit caps.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SOP-5.6  Step F room relationship) Tj
T*
(   Apply valid proportionate deduction only to eligible room-linked items.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SOP-5.7  Step G deductible and co-pay) Tj
T*
(   Apply member cost sharing in schedule order.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SOP-5.8  Step H available balance) Tj
T*
(   Cap by available sum insured and activate restoration only when criteria are met.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SOP-5.9  Step I other recoveries) Tj
T*
(   Coordinate with other insurance and record net insurer liability.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
endstream
