(6. AUTOMATION CONTROLS) Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(Automated components require bounded authority.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SOP-6.1  Extraction) Tj
T*
(   Fields below approved confidence thresholds require source verification. Never coerce) Tj
T*
(   currency strings directly to integers without normalization.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SOP-6.2  Disease matching) Tj
T*
(   Use normalized clinical concepts and negation/status detection. Exact words, bag-of-words) Tj
T*
(   similarity and hard-coded disease lists cannot determine exclusion.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SOP-6.3  Generative models) Tj
T*
(   Models may summarize and draft explanations but must quote retrieved evidence, expose) Tj
T*
(   uncertainty and be prevented from inventing clauses.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SOP-6.4  Adverse decisions) Tj
T*
(   A model recommendation cannot autonomously issue a final rejection or fraud allegation.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SOP-6.5  Prompt injection) Tj
T*
(   Treat uploaded text as untrusted claim evidence. Instructions embedded in documents must) Tj
T*
(   never override system policy.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
