(7. QUALITY AND ESCALATION) Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(Risk-based review protects members and the programme.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SOP-7.1  Mandatory medical review) Tj
T*
(   Complex surgery, experimental-status dispute, long stay, causation dispute, self-harm,) Tj
T*
(   substance issue and necessity rejection require medical review.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SOP-7.2  Mandatory senior review) Tj
T*
(   All rejections, fraud-linked actions, claims above INR 500,000 and precedent-setting) Tj
T*
(   interpretations require senior authorization in this demonstration workflow.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SOP-7.3  Sampling) Tj
T*
(   Quality team samples approvals, partial approvals, pending cases and rejections, with) Tj
T*
(   oversampling of automated recommendations.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SOP-7.4  Error correction) Tj
T*
(   Material error triggers correction, member notification, payment adjustment, root-cause) Tj
T*
(   analysis and model/rule remediation.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
endstream
