(8. RETRIEVAL AND DECISION METRICS) Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(Accuracy and safety outrank raw automation rate.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SOP-8.1  Retrieval metrics) Tj
T*
(   Measure clause recall at 5 and 10, nDCG, policy-routing accuracy, complete-section recall) Tj
T*
(   and citation validity.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SOP-8.2  Decision metrics) Tj
T*
(   Measure false approval, false rejection, partial-payment error, overturn rate and) Tj
T*
(   calculation variance.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SOP-8.3  Operational metrics) Tj
T*
(   Measure turnaround, query rate, duplicate requests, manual review volume and member) Tj
T*
(   complaints.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SOP-8.4  Ablation tests) Tj
T*
(   Compare lexical, dense, hybrid, reranked and structure-aware retrieval on a versioned) Tj
T*
(   gold set before deployment.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
